prompt
Act as a Nutritionist to generate a 7-day tamilnadu vegetarian style weight loss meal plan for the person. Sample meal recommendtaion is using siruthaniyam and vegetables. create the output in tabular form

Output:
| Day       | Early Morning                                  | Breakfast                                                | Mid-Morning             | Lunch                                                               | Evening Snack                               | Dinner                                                     |
| --------- | ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| **Day 1** | Warm water + lemon                             | **Kambu (pearl millet) vegetable dosa** + tomato chutney | 1 guava                 | Brown rice + mixed vegetable sambar + keerai poriyal + cucumber     | Sundal (small bowl)                         | **Thinai (foxtail millet) vegetable upma** + curd          |
| **Day 2** | Warm water                                     | **Ragi vegetable idli** + sambar                         | Papaya bowl             | **Samai (little millet) rice** + rasam + beans poriyal + salad      | Buttermilk + roasted chana                  | Vegetable soup + 2 small millet rotis                      |
| **Day 3** | Jeera water                                    | **Thinai pongal** with vegetables + sambar               | 1 apple                 | Red rice + keerai kootu + vegetable poriyal + rasam                 | Sprouts salad                               | **Kuthiraivali (barnyard millet) vegetable khichdi**       |
| **Day 4** | Warm water + soaked fenugreek water (optional) | **Kambu koozh** + small bowl of vegetables               | Orange / mosambi        | **Varagu (kodo millet) lemon rice** + vegetable sambar + salad      | Green tea + roasted peanuts (small handful) | Vegetable adai made with millet + tomato chutney           |
| **Day 5** | Warm water                                     | **Ragi dosa** + mint chutney + sambar                    | Watermelon bowl         | Brown rice + mor kuzhambu + cabbage poriyal + salad                 | Boiled corn or sundal                       | **Samai vegetable pulao** + cucumber raita                 |
| **Day 6** | Jeera water                                    | **Vegetable millet pongal** + chutney                    | 1 pear / seasonal fruit | **Thinai curd rice** (moderate portion) + vegetable poriyal + rasam | Buttermilk + roasted chana                  | Mixed vegetable soup + 2 small whole-wheat/millet chapatis |
| **Day 7** | Warm water                                     | **Kuthiraivali vegetable idli** + sambar                 | Papaya / guava          | **Varagu vegetable biryani** + onion-cucumber raita + salad         | Sundal or sprouts                           | Light **ragi vegetable kanji** + sautéed vegetables        |
